   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "<b>Nabhas (Heavenly) Yogas</b>",
   "bbox": [
    322,
    713,
    1385,
    841
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "नवदिग्वसवस्त्रिकाग्निवेदैर्गुणिता द्वित्रिचतुर्विकल्पजा: स्यु:।",
   "bbox": [
    324,
    980,
    1167,
    1064
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "यवनैस्त्रिगुणाहिषट्शती सा कथिता विस्तरतोऽत्र तत्समासत:।। 1 ।।",
   "bbox": [
    325,
    1032,
    1319,
    1131
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The common heading \"Nabhas\" includes three main types",
   "bbox": [
    328,
    1111,
    1483,
    1221
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "of yogas:",
   "bbox": [
    261,
    1226,
    445,
    1268
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "(a) Aakriti (आकृति) Yogas-dealing with the position of",
   "bbox": [
    333,
    1249,
    1494,
    1346
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "planets in different houses.",
   "bbox": [
    264,
    1331,
    819,
    1402
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "(b) Aashraya (आश्रय) Yogas-dealing with the position of",
   "bbox": [
    339,
    1378,
    1498,
    1481
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "planet in different signs.",
   "bbox": [
    269,
    1467,
    770,
    1531
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "(c) Sankhya (संख्या) Yogas-dealing with the question of the",
   "bbox": [
    344,
    1512,
    1499,
    1608
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "number of houses occupied by all the planets.",
   "bbox": [
    275,
    1580,
    1192,
    1662
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "रज्जुर्मुशलं नलश्चराद्यै: सत्यश्चाश्रयजाञ्जगाद योगान्।",
   "bbox": [
    348,
    1658,
    1082,
    1748
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "केन्द्रै: सदसद्युतैर्दलाख्यौ स्रक्सपौँ कथितौ पराशरेण।। 2 ।।",
   "bbox": [
    350,
    1717,
    1222,
    1811
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "The number of Aakriti Yogas is 20, that of Ashraya Yogas",
   "bbox": [
    355,
    1798,
    1510,
    1901
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "is 5 and that of Sankhya Yogas is 7. Thus there are in all 32",
   "bbox": [
    281,
    1851,
    1514,
    1957
   ]
